# Research repository upload allowlist
#
# The workspace contains nearly 1 GB of datasets, model responses, audit logs,
# and derived experimental artifacts. Ignore those by default, while retaining
# executable source code and the small prompt/schema/dependency files required
# to understand and reproduce the pipeline.
research/**

# Git must be allowed to traverse ignored subdirectories before individual
# source files can be re-included.
!research/**/

# Executable source and tests
!research/**/*.py
!research/**/*.sh
!research/**/*.sql

# Dependency and build configuration
!research/**/requirements*.txt
!research/**/pyproject.toml
!research/**/*.toml
!research/**/*.yaml
!research/**/*.yml

# Model interfaces required by the executable pipeline
!research/**/*.schema.json
!research/**/*prompt*.txt
!research/**/*PROMPT*.txt

# Source-oriented documentation, when present
!research/**/README.md
!research/**/README*.md

# External local dataset snapshot. Research manifests and derived evidence under
# research/ remain trackable; the separately acquired corpus is intentionally not.
OSSGameBench/
